<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 4,410 T U.S. wheat for Senegal.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 4,410 T U.S. wheat for Senegal.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it is seeking up to 4,410 tonnes of U.S. No. 2 soft red winter or soft white whear, ordinary protein, maximum moisture 13.5 percent for donation to Senegal.</p>
<p>Shipment period is set for October 5-31 and offers are due by September 18.</p>
<p>The wheat must be tested for vomitoxin and originate in areas of the U.S. where Karnal Bunt is not known to occur.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>-- Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
